    <div style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&#160;</p></div>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 67.5pt; text-indent: -67.5pt; background-color: white"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Proposal
1: Share Authorization Proposal</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 67.5pt; text-indent: -67.5pt; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: white">The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved
an amendment to the Charter, to increase the number of authorized shares of Common Stock from 154,437,500 to 1,389,937,500, increasing
the total number of authorized shares of Common Stock and preferred stock from 164,437,500 to 1,399,937,500. The final voting results,
including 4,500,000,000 votes represented by the share of Series A Preferred Stock voted in the same proportion as the votes cast by shares
of Common Stock on Proposal 1, are as follows:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

